1
00:00:12,670 --> 00:00:19,385
The rain taps gently on the glass, 
I watch the silent minutes pass.

2
00:00:19,556 --> 00:00:31,472
The pastor asks: "What will you do?" 
They wait for me to guide them through.

3
00:00:36,475 --> 00:00:49,168
I let the music fade away, 
I have no words left here to say.

4
00:00:50,144 --> 00:01:09,130
I give up all, I let it fall, 
But Luna, I keep through all!

5
00:01:20,879 --> 00:01:27,719
I tell them all I cannot play, 
My chair scrapes hard, I walk away.

6
00:01:27,860 --> 00:01:41,043
The chairman stares in blank surprise, 
And sorrow fills the pastor’s eyes.

7
00:01:44,989 --> 00:01:58,185
I let the music fade away, 
I have no words left here to say.

8
00:01:58,674 --> 00:02:17,523
I give up all, I let it fall, 
But Luna, I keep through all!

9
00:02:30,018 --> 00:02:36,369
I walk into the silent nave, 
This temple feels just like a grave.

10
00:02:36,535 --> 00:02:51,015
I look up at the organ loft, 
Where I once loved you, silent, soft.

11
00:02:53,553 --> 00:03:06,935
I let the music fade away, 
I have no words left here to say.

12
00:03:07,333 --> 00:03:26,146
I give up all, I let it fall, 
But Luna, I keep through all!

13
00:03:52,077 --> 00:03:59,037
The songs I loved are worthless now, 
Without you, there's no holy vow.

14
00:03:59,191 --> 00:04:11,275
I cannot play, I cannot sing, 
Your absence kills what joy could bring.

15
00:04:15,857 --> 00:04:28,782
I let the music fade away, 
I have no words left here to say.

16
00:04:29,571 --> 00:04:48,059
I give up all, I let it fall, 
But Luna, I keep through all!

17
00:05:14,345 --> 00:05:21,008
I let them take my sacred keys, 
I let the wind blow through the trees.

18
00:05:21,099 --> 00:05:33,930
I will never let go of you, 
No matter what they force me through!

